[[File:Prime Minister of Bharat, Shri Narendra Damodardas Modi looks on at the wreckage of the crashed Air India Flight 171 (cropped).jpg|thumb|The wreckage of [[Air India Flight 171]]'s tail section wedged into the [[B. J. Medical College, Ahmedabad]] on June 13]]
