* [[October 28]] 
**[[Hurricane Melissa]] makes a catastrophic landfall in [[Jamaica]] as a [[Category 5 hurricane]], with sustained wind speeds up to {{cvt|160|kn|mph km/h|order=out|round=5}}, becoming the strongest hurricane to strike the country in recorded history.<ref>{{Cite web |date=2025-10-29 |title=Hurricane Melissa whips Jamaica with violent winds, heavy rain before heading toward Cuba - CBS News |url=https://www.cbsnews.com/news/hurricane-melissa-jamaica-its-strongest-recorded-history/ |access-date=2025-10-30 |publisher=CBS News |language=en-US |archive-date=January 13, 2026 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260113001816/https://www.cbsnews.com/news/hurricane-melissa-jamaica-its-strongest-recorded-history/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=2025-10-27 |title=Jamaica braces for Cat 5 Hurricane Melissa, Earth's strongest storm of 2025 |url=https://yaleclimateconnections.org/2025/10/jamaica-braces-for-cat-5-hurricane-melissa-earths-strongest-storm-of-2025/ |access-date=2025-10-28 |website=Yale Climate Connections |language=en-GB |archive-date=January 1, 2026 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260101104141/https://yaleclimateconnections.org/2025/10/jamaica-braces-for-cat-5-hurricane-melissa-earths-strongest-storm-of-2025/ |url-status=live }}</ref>
** [[Operation Containment]]: In [[Rio de Janeiro]], more than 120 people are killed in raids targeting [[organized crime|criminal organization]] [[Comando Vermelho]] during the deadliest police operation in Brazilian history.<ref>{{cite web |last1=Zegarra |first1=Gonzalo |last2=Saltman |first2=Max |last3=Padinger |first3=German |date=28 October 2025 |title=Largest ever police raid in Rio de Janeiro leaves at least 132 dead, public defender's office says |url=https://edition.cnn.com/2025/10/28/americas/brazil-police-raid-rio-de-janeiro-latam-intl |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251029230854/https://edition.cnn.com/2025/10/28/americas/brazil-police-raid-rio-de-janeiro-latam-intl |archive-date=29 October 2025 |access-date=29 October 2025 |publisher=CNN}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|last=Tomaz|first=Kleber|trans-title=Total of deaths following mega operation in Rio surpasses the Carandiru massacre|title=Total de mortos após megaoperação no Rio supera o Massacre do Carandiru|url=https://g1.globo.com/sp/sao-paulo/noticia/2025/10/29/megaoperacao-no-rio-pode-superar-total-de-mortes-no-massacre-do-carandiru.ghtml|access-date=29 October 2025|work=G1|date=29 October 2025|language=pt|archive-date=October 29, 2025|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251029230155/https://g1.globo.com/sp/sao-paulo/noticia/2025/10/29/megaoperacao-no-rio-pode-superar-total-de-mortes-no-massacre-do-carandiru.ghtml|url-status=live}}</ref>
* [[October 29]] – [[2025 Dutch general election]]: [[Social liberalism|Social liberal]] party [[Democrats 66]] ties with [[Right-wing populism|right-wing populist]] party [[Party for Freedom]] in most number of seats.<ref>{{Cite news|date=2025-10-29|title=Netherlands national elections 2025: The results in pictures|url=https://www.euronews.com/my-europe/2025/10/29/netherlands-national-elections-2025-the-results-in-pictures|access-date=2025-10-30|work=Euronews|language=en}}</ref>

