** [[Typhoon Kalmaegi]] leaves more than 288 people dead in the [[Philippines]], [[Vietnam]], and [[Thailand]].<ref>{{cite news|title=Typhoon Kalmaegi brings rain and destruction to Vietnam as death toll nears 200 in Philippines|url=https://www.reuters.com/business/environment/typhoon-kalmaegi-brings-rain-destruction-vietnam-death-toll-nears-200-2025-11-07/|date=2025-11-07|access-date=2025-11-07|work=[[Reuters]]|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://vnexpress.net/5-nguoi-chet-hon-2-600-nha-hu-hong-do-bao-kalmaegi-4961051.html|language=vi|work=[[VnExpress]]|access-date=2025-11-07|date=2025-11-07|title=5 người chết, hơn 2.600 nhà hư hỏng do bão Kalmaegi}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|date=2025-11-07|title=Heavy flooding affects 15 provinces of Thailand leaving 13 dead
